cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code, please cite the paper and this repository."
title: "ATSP: a certifying implementation of the Bell-Frieze quasi-polynomial algorithm"
abstract: >-
  Reference implementation of the Bell-Frieze quasi-polynomial algorithm for the
  random asymmetric traveling salesman problem, with an optimality certificate,
  the benchmark drivers, and the ATSPLIB instances used in the paper.
